  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "24. Core Abilities",
    "ruleNumber": "24.07",
    "summary": "A unit with at least one model carrying a **[CLOSE-QUARTERS]** weapon may use the [Close-Quarters Shooting](vsdata:core-rule/close-quarters-shooting) type (10.06). Under any other shooting type, each of the unit's models other than **MONSTER** and **VEHICLE** models must choose between its **[CLOSE-QUARTERS]** weapons and its other ranged weapons, using one or more from one set only. The printed **[[PISTOL]](vsdata:weapon-ability/pistol)** entry (24.27) declares **[[PISTOL]](vsdata:weapon-ability/pistol)** the same ability as **[CLOSE-QUARTERS]**.",
